    "content": "{\"sections\":[{\"key\":\"buying_signals\",\"empty\":false,\"items\":[{\"h2\":\"27 open requisitions, including 11 in Sales and 3 in Marketing (September 2, 2026)\",\"body\":[{\"text\":\"As of September 2, 2026, Zafran had 27 open requisitions, including 11 in Sales and 3 in Marketing.\",\"claimIds\":[\"zaf-088\"]},{\"text\":\"What it means for us: this is a broad hiring push, so a scalable way to coordinate account research and campaigns is timely.\",\"claimIds\":[\"zaf-088\"]}],\"contactRefs\":[],\"priority\":1},{\"h2\":\"ABM program being built from scratch; role open 77 days (June 17, 2026)\",\"body\":[{\"text\":\"On June 17, 2026, Zafran posted a Senior Manager, ABM & Integrated Campaigns role, with the program described as \\\"being built from scratch\\\" and the position open for 77 days.\",\"claimIds\":[\"zaf-090\"]},{\"text\":\"The role says, \\\"Own ABM from the ground up: 1:1 programs for your most strategic targets, 1:few cluster plays for high-potential segments, and scaled 1:many motions where volume matters.\\\"\",\"claimIds\":[\"zaf-090\"]},{\"text\":\"What it means for us: Zafran is actively defining its account tiers, buying-group mapping, and coordinated go-to-market motion.\",\"claimIds\":[\"zaf-090\"]}],\"contactRefs\":[],\"priority\":1},{\"h2\":\"Partner and alliances channel being built from zero (September 1, 2026)\",\"body\":[{\"text\":\"On September 1, 2026, Zafran posted a Director of Alliances role to build a partner and alliances channel from zero.\",\"claimIds\":[\"zaf-091\"]},{\"text\":\"The posting says, \\\"Our partner ecosystem is becoming one of the fastest ways security teams discover and adopt Zafran, and we're looking for a Director of Alliances to build that engine from scratch.\\\"\",\"claimIds\":[\"zaf-091\"]},{\"text\":\"What it means for us: new partner-led routes to market may create additional account and campaign coordination needs.\",\"claimIds\":[\"zaf-091\"]}],\"contactRefs\":[],\"priority\":1},{\"h2\":\"AI-driven hiring needs across engineering, sales, customer success, and infrastructure\",\"body\":[{\"text\":\"Zafran said its rapid AI development is driving hiring across engineering, sales, customer success, and core infrastructure as it scales to meet demand.\",\"claimIds\":[\"zaf-129\"]},{\"text\":\"The company stated, \\\"The development in AI is very fast, and we need more people.\\\"\",\"claimIds\":[\"zaf-129\"]},{\"text\":\"What it means for us: expansion across several functions gives us multiple teams and use cases to align around account-based outreach.\",\"claimIds\":[\"zaf-129\"]}],\"contactRefs\":[],\"priority\":1}]}]}",
